<title>USA: First Union wins Cabarrus County, N.C., $49 mln GO.</title>
<headline>First Union wins Cabarrus County, N.C., $49 mln GO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp said it won $49 million of Cabarrus County, N.C., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost (NIC) of 5.32 percent.</p>
</text>
